   hoist may make the term 2/3, not fix it. **Source read only. Do not act on it unmeasured.**
   **STAGE 5 (the pose spine) still precedes STAGE 6 (stereo).**
5. **~~BLACK TRIANGLES AT 90 Hz~~ — SOLVED. `268`. NOT THE RENDERER.**
